      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "HELM DRUMS - standalone beat box\n\nClocked  = master clock (BPM knob + RUN light)\n  OUT 0  -> Kick      every quarter note\n  OUT 1  -> HiHat     x2 = eighth notes\n  OUT 2  -> CR78 perc x1 = quarter notes\n\nTIPS\n- Clocked knobs 'Clk 1/2/3 ratio':\n  negative number = slower, positive = faster\n- If one drum stays silent, drag that\n  cable onto the module's TRIG jack\n- Drums are the WSTD/DrumKit set:\n  BassDrum9, ClosedHiHat, CR78\n\n",
        "width": 30
      },
      "pos": [
        23,
        1
      ]
    },
